<title>FRANCE: Dassault Electronique swings to H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Dassault Electronique swings to H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		 profit   20.3  vs     loss 50</p>
<p>    Operating			  profit   43.8  vs     loss 51.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional     profit   54.4  vs     loss 30.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Dassault Electronique issued its half-year results in a statement. It said its order book was up 8.1 percent at 1.64 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
